    "aliases": [
      "CVE-2025-9363"
    ],
    "details": "A vulnerability has been found in Linksys RE6250, RE6300, RE6350, RE6500, RE7000 and RE9000 1.0.013.001/1.0.04.001/1.0.04.002/1.1.05.003/1.2.07.001. This affects the function portTriggerManageRule of the file /goform/portTriggerManageRule. The manipulation of the argument triggerRuleName/schedule leads to stack-based buffer overflow. Remote exploitation of the attack is possible. The exploit has been disclosed to the public and may be used. The vendor was contacted early about this disclosure but did not respond in any way.",
